  - Clang
abstract: >-
  A theory of cost bounds of imperative programs as constrained optimization, a cost logic
  and a checker of cost certificates proved sound in Lean 4, a Clang plugin that produces
  such certificates for C and C++ functions, and certified cycle bounds of Cortex-M0
  machine code.
